+        <h1>Test the change.<br>Then decide what to ship.</h1>
+        <p>A practical guide to dynamic Cost/History studies, brain parameters and code changes through <b>@phorvexbot</b>: write a precise request, inspect the tests, and compare your candidate with the baseline brain.</p>
+        <div class="hero-bottom"><span class="hero-tag">English edition</span><span>Copyable examples</span><span>Study, parameter and code workflows</span><span>HTML + CSV reports</span></div>
